amie-motion-381-eat = { $pokemon } tips its head back and chews. Then it bobs its head and tilts it from side to side.
amie-motion-381-happyA = { $pokemon } dips its head and raises its wings high, with its arms held out. Then it lifts its head again.
amie-motion-381-happyB = { $pokemon } swoops off to one side and out of sight. Then it dives back in head first and rises up tall.
amie-motion-381-happyC = { $pokemon } darts out of sight and nosedives past head first, twice. Then it rises so tall that its head disappears, and settles.
amie-motion-381-hate = { $pokemon } darts up and backward until its head is out of sight. Then it drifts back down to where it was.
amie-motion-381-lonely = { $pokemon } turns aside and lets its neck droop lower and lower. After a while, it turns back to face forward.
amie-motion-381-mad = { $pokemon } ducks low with its head down. Then it rears up with its neck stretched tall and its arms thrown out.
amie-motion-381-moveA = { $pokemon } turns its neck and body to one side and looks off that way. Then it turns back to face forward.
amie-motion-381-moveC = { $pokemon } tilts from side to side, swinging its arms out each way. Then it settles upright.
amie-motion-381-playA = { $pokemon } tips far forward with its wings raised high. Then it rocks back and tips its head up.
amie-motion-381-sleep = { $pokemon } sinks down and lies flat on the ground. Then it lifts up off the ground for a moment, and lies back down.
amie-motion-381-touch = { $pokemon } raises one arm and holds up its hand. Then it lowers it again.

# Kyogre
amie-motion-382-eat = { $pokemon } opens its toothy mouth wide and snaps it shut. Then it dips forward and chews, rocking slightly.
amie-motion-382-happyB = { $pokemon } rears up high and shows its white belly, with its fins spread wide. Then it sinks back down.
amie-motion-382-hate = { $pokemon } bares its teeth with its mouth wide open. Then it raises its tail fins high behind its head, and lowers them again.

# Groudon
amie-motion-383-eat = { $pokemon } tips its head back and opens its jaws a little. Then it lowers its head and chews.
amie-motion-383-happyB = { $pokemon } turns its head aside. Then it throws its head back with its jaws wide open, and lowers it again.
amie-motion-383-hate = { $pokemon } thrusts its head forward and roars with its huge jaws wide open. Then it shuts its jaws again.

# Rayquaza
amie-motion-384-drowse = { $pokemon } lowers its head and shuts its jaws, and its head droops and nods. Then it jerks its head back up with its jaws open.
amie-motion-384-eat = { $pokemon } raises its head with its jaws wide open. Then it lowers its head and chews, its jaws opening and closing.
amie-motion-384-happyB = { $pokemon } dips its head low. Then it rears its head up high with its jaws wide open and its arms spread.
amie-motion-384-hate = { $pokemon } ducks its head and twists away, coiling its long body. Then it stretches its neck straight up and swoops its head back down with jaws open.
amie-motion-384-mad = { $pokemon } lowers its head and lunges forward with its jaws open, its long body sweeping close past. Then it rears up with its jaws gaping wide.

# Jirachi
amie-motion-385-drowse = { $pokemon } bows its star-shaped head and shuts its eyes, its long ribbons drooping to the ground. Then it jerks upright and flings its ribbons out.
amie-motion-385-eat = { $pokemon } opens its mouth and smiles, its ribbons spread wide. Then it tilts its head from side to side as it chews.
amie-motion-385-happyB = { $pokemon } tilts its head with a happy smile. Then it rises and spins right around in the air, its ribbons swirling, and lands facing forward.
amie-motion-385-hate = { $pokemon } turns aside and hunches, wrapping its ribbons tight around itself. Then it lets them drop and spreads them out wide again.

# Deoxys
amie-motion-386-eat = { $pokemon } curls its long arms up across its chest and holds them there. Then it sweeps one arm across its middle and lets both hang down again.
amie-motion-386-happyB = { $pokemon } swings its long arms out wide to both sides and holds them there. Then it lets them fall back to its sides.
amie-motion-386-hate = { $pokemon } crouches low on bent legs with its arms curled out to the sides. Then it straightens back up and lets its arms hang.
amie-motion-386-1-eat = { $pokemon } coils one long arm up in a loop across its chest and holds it there. Then it lets the arm uncurl and hang down.
amie-motion-386-1-happyB = { $pokemon } sweeps its long, ribbon-like arms out wide to both sides. Then it lets them fall back down to its sides.
amie-motion-386-1-hate = { $pokemon } crouches low on bent legs with its long arms flung out to both sides. Then it straightens up and lets its arms swing back down.
amie-motion-386-2-eat = { $pokemon } curls one thick arm up across its middle to its chest and holds it there. Then it lowers the arm to hang at its side.
amie-motion-386-2-happyB = { $pokemon } lifts its thick outer arms out wide to both sides. Then it lowers them back to its sides.
amie-motion-386-2-hate = { $pokemon } hunches forward with its head down and bends its thick arms across its body. Then it straightens up and lets them hang.
amie-motion-386-3-eat = { $pokemon } loops one thin arm up across its chest and holds it there. Then it lowers the arm back to its side.
amie-motion-386-3-happyB = { $pokemon } swings its long, thin arms slowly out wide to both sides. Then it lets them curve back down to its sides.
amie-motion-386-3-hate = { $pokemon } ducks low and bends its thin arms into hoops in front of it. Then it rises, sweeping its arms out, and lets them hang.
